D FX geometry plus alpha-blended mist; no rendered image planes of the creature. FX are authored at 1/100 scale inside the body and revealed with ordinary scale keys. All textures embedded. Source is one view, so unseen surfaces are inferred. Native mesh geometry is used for faceted ice; this is not a Java block or Bedrock cube-only project."}